    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="mq" value="&lt;b&gt;RabbitMQ&lt;/b&gt; — driven by Messaging.Transport over Messaging.Contracts&lt;br&gt;orchestrator-fanout (Start/Stop announcements, assignment changes) · per-processor work queues · NextStepHandoff · StepResult&lt;br&gt;QueueSender with publisher confirms · QueueDepthProbe / QueueStatsProbe on their own connection (skp-probe) · SendFaultClassifier · dead-letter pairs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#1a1a1a;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
